WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.520
Kocap kacarita, biyen ana crita Timun Mas sing wani.

2
00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:15.320
Biyen ana Mbok Rondho sing urip dhewe, dheweke kepengin banget duwe anak wadon.

3
00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:23.464
Buto Ijo menehi wiji timun ajaib, banjur tuwuh dadi bocah ayu jenenge Timun Mas.

4
00:00:24.264 --> 00:00:32.264
Nalika Timun Mas wis gedhe, Buto Ijo teka njaluk janji, Timun Mas wedi banjur mlayu.

5
00:00:33.064 --> 00:00:42.592
Timun Mas nyebar wiji timun, jarum, lan uyah, dadi kebon, eri, lan segara kanggo ngalang-alangi buto.

6
00:00:43.392 --> 00:00:51.840
Pungkasan Timun Mas nyebar terasi dadi segara lendhut, Buto Ijo kejebak lan nyerah, Timun Mas bali slamet.
